About:

An attempt to incorporate my dice_restart patch into the oagertz patch, which makes use of dice.

It boils down to adapting two files: init_part.f90 and read_param.f90.

The strategy is to insert the missing snippets into these two from the corresponding files in oagertz/dice. Some other adjustments in init_part.f90 will be necessary, such as:

		- Reading in 'nmetals' metals (rather than one only and setting to 2)
			- for gas cells
				-> seems to be taken care of by nvar_min but CHECK consistency between nvar_min and nmetals

		- Reading in stellar birth masses (need to get the previous right)

		- Reading TRACER properties (need to get the previous right)

See oagertz/output_partf.f90 for a guide (and pm_commons.f90 for the correct corresponding variable kinds)
